     "body": "<p>Pending response from <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a>, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" data-account-id=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" accountid=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Michael Durbin</a>, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" data-account-id=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" accountid=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Unknown</a> re:value of further effort in the fcrepo4-client project.<br/>\nQuite likely this ticket will be \"closed - will not fix\", despite the strong implementation.</p>",
