  "description": "<p>The Java client should inspect the headers of NonRDFSources to find where the description is, rather than adding fcr:metadata to the end of the NonRDFSource URI.</p>\n\n<p>When creating a NonRDFSource or doing a HEAD on it, there will be a Link rel=\"describedby\" header indicating the URI of the description.</p>",
